{
  "_about": "FICTIONAL recorded exchange for the Azure Key Vault adapter. Hand-built from the public REST API shapes (Key Vault keys: Get Key and Sign, api-version 7.4). The vault, key, version and token are placeholders; {{…}} values are filled at test time from a P-256 key generated inside the test. No real vault, tenant, credential or token.",
